\section{Typical workflow}{

\enumerate{
\item \code{d <- hp_read_data("study.csv")}
\item \code{e <- hp_eda_prepare(d, lloq = 0.5)} then plots and tables with
\code{\link[=hp_eda_plot]{hp_eda_plot()}} and \code{\link[=hp_eda_table]{hp_eda_table()}}.
\item \code{res <- hp_nca(d, route = "oral", lloq = 0.5)} then
\code{res$parameters}, \code{res$summary} and \code{\link[=hp_nca_plots]{hp_nca_plots()}}.
\item Save with \code{\link[=hp_save_table]{hp_save_table()}} and \code{\link[=hp_save_plots]{hp_save_plots()}}.
}

The vignettes walk through each step: \code{browseVignettes("hyperutils")}.
